        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandi mun gai aniu khou puang mei",
            "Timaan lou o zingpui bam khou hei.",
            "Zingmei ruina achaeng maan the",
            "Zauzian loupui bam jordan paeng khou hei.",
            "",
            "Ata nduang lou o.",
            "Rianrapui ram zing mei khou hei,",
            "Ata nduang lou o, Immanual Guang jisu.",
            "",
            "2. Kandi khou lik kandiu Guangh jisu",
            "Nzianlou mei nang lat gaimei hei,",
            "Nangzan nthan mei thuan ku khang,",
            "Ting mik thui tithai o kalvary lat.",
            "",
            "3. Zianmei nun tampui bam kandi hei,",
            "Kapma huai bam e kanlou meipu.",
            "Thukpui zei rui kanloumei guay.",
            "Tingkao mun gai neihlana guang datro.",
            "",
            "4. Guang jisu ganphiu gan gaimei Pu.",
            "Gan guang datro alung zing mei khou.",
            "Zingpui ram khou bam mei guai ta.",
            "Ganlou datna nang rui zai guang datro."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
